<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile to consider 10-mln lb nickel sale.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile to consider 10-mln lb nickel sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center is planning to sell approximately 10 million pounds of nickel in a negotiated sale, according to a draft solicitation.</p>
<p>Bids are due August 28, the draft said.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
